### 4. Complete Data Flow (After Implementation)

```
1. User uploads Excel in signer-form.vue
2. item-crud.vue handleSubmit() sends to backend
3. Backend importDocumentsPackagesFields() returns:
   - data[] with variableValues per record
   - variableHeaders: ["VAR_NOMBRE", "VAR_FECHA", ...]  <-- NEW
4. item-crud.vue checks if variables exist
5. If yes: load savedMappingConfig from backend, open MappingPreview dialog
6. mapping-preview.vue:
   a. Auto-detects matches between VAR_NOMBRE <-> [$NOMBRE]
   b. Shows mapping table with manual override via v-select
   c. Renders PDF preview with first record's values in variable positions
   d. User confirms mapping
7. item-crud.vue onMappingConfirmed():
   a. Re-keys variableValues in all records based on confirmed mapping
   b. Calls fillTable() to show records dialog
8. User reviews records, clicks save
9. item-crud.vue saveData() sends to backend updatePdfContentMassive()
   - variableValues are now correctly keyed to match PDF field names
10. Backend modifyPdfWithFields() renders values into PDFs using pdf-lib
```

